ÅTi mporo tora na sas po gia to biblio kai gia to pos mporei kalutera na to diabasei kaneis; Tha arkhiso me ten alazonike apaitese na men to diabasete mia phora, alla duo. Mia apaitese pou den khreiazetai bebaia na ikanopoiethei, an kapoios ekhei ede barethei me ten prote anagnose. Ena ergo tekhnes den prepei na apotelei kathekon, oute prospatheia* den prepei na to analambanei kaneis para te thelese tou. O stokhos tou einai na parekhei eukharistese, na psukhagogei kai na anazoogonei. An den ekhei auta ta apotelesmata se kapoion anagnoste, autos prepei na to paratesei kai na straphei se kati allo. An omos ekhete diabasei to Magiko bouno mia phora, sas sunisto na to diabasete kai mia deutere. O tropos me ton opoio ekhei suntethei to biblio ekhei apotelesma e apolause tou anagnoste apo te deutere anagnose na einai bathutere. Akribos opos kai ste mousike khreiazetai kaneis na gnorizei ena kommati gia na to eukharistethei opos prepei, khresimopoiesa epitedes te lexe "suntethei" anapheromenos ste suggraphe enos bibliou. To ennoo me ten ennoia me ten opoia sunethestera te khresimopoioume prokeimenou gia te mousike. Dioti e mousike eikhe anekathen mia iskhure diaplasmatike epidrase sto suggraphiko mou uphos. Oi suggrapheis polu sukhna einai "pragmatika" kati allo: einai metemphuteumenoi zographoi e gluptes e arkhitektones e otidepote. Gia mena to muthistorema etan panta san mia sumphonia, ena ergo antistixes, ena thematiko oikodomema* e idea tou mousikou motibou paizei semantiko rolo se auto.
Diaphoroi ekhoun episemanei ten epirroe tes mousikes tou Bagkner sto ergo mou. Oposdepote den arnoumai ten epirroe aute. Sugkekrimena akolouthesa ton Bagkner ste khrese tou Leitmotiv, to opoio metephera sto khoro tes glossas. Okhi opos to metakheiristekan o Tolstoi kai o Zola, e opos to khresimopoiesa kai ego o idios stous Mpountenmprouks, natouralistika kai os meso kharakterismou - san na leme mekhanika. Prospathesa na to khresimopoieso me te mousike tou ennoia. Oi protes mou tetoies apopeires etan ston Tonio Kregker. Alla e tekhnike pou khresimopoiesa ekei emphanizetai polu pio aneptugmene sto Magiko bouno khresimopoieitai me enan polu perissotero periploko tropo, pou diapotizei ta panta. -- Tomas Man, "Pos graphteke to Magiko bouno" (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"è
åTo patoma etan marmarino kai oi toikhoi etan diakosmemenoi me gupsina anaglupha ta opoia e egkataleipse eikhe phrontisei na ta kanei agnorista. Kati kinetheke anamesa sta agriokhorta. Mporei na etan arouraios. Tora omos ole mou e prosokhe eikhe sugkentrothei se mia diplophulle porta. Apo ekei ebgaine e mousike kai epises enas pagomenos aeras pou xaphnika stegnose ton idrota sto prosopo mou. Mesa ekei, photismene apo tesseris proboleis pou kremontan se kati terastia dokaria, mia kopela ekane patinaz s'ena pagodromio...
E Z, mia mikre touristike pole stis aktes tes Katalonias, to kalokairi, o kausonas, prosopa sugkinetika kai asteia, adunatoi erotes, katakhreseis kondulion, katapontismenes politikes philodoxies, ereipia pou stegazoun mustika, kai treis ekdokhes enos egklematos: idou to skeniko pou stenei o Romperto Mpolanio gia auto to paraligo astunomiko muthistorema, pou photizetai apo to melagkholiko kai sklero khioumor tou.
Tria prosopa pairnoun to logo san na ekhoume treis diadokhikous rolous: enas apogoeteumenos Khilianos suggrapheas, enas Mexikanos poietes khoris adeia paramones, nukhtophulakas se kampingk, kai enas demotikos upallelos etoimos na ta kanei ola gia te gunaika pou agapa. Miloun gia tous erotes tous, gia tis autapates pou trephoun, gia to diaphoretiko tous pepromeno, pou to ekhei magnetisei, se olous anexairetos, o thanatos.
To Pagodromio ekhei ola ta diakritika tou logotekhnikou sumpantos tou Romperto Mpolanio: tis diaplekomenes phones pou anaggelloun katopines poluphonies, ton kodika tou astunomikou muthistorematos, tous katestrammenous erotes, tis khamenes autapates. Epises, ten ikanoteta tou suggraphea na paraterei ten pragmatikoteta kai na ten ermeneuei me idiaitero tropo. Briskoume kai edo ton aphegematiko palmo tou e to aneleeto khioumor tou, pou aikhmalotizoun ton anagnoste apo ten prote selida, idiotetes pou ekhoun katastesei ta erga tou muthistoremata anaphoras sten epokhe mas. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)
"O Mpolanio estiazei ston diko tou idiaitero kosmo, sten apogumnomene ki omorphe poiese tou" (Revista de Libros)
"O Mpolanio einai o Mpolanio... pantote. Den se apogoeteuei pote" (La Voz de Galicia)"ó
îSton paronta tomo sugkentronontai pente apo tis gnostoteres kai demophilesteres istories tou Stephan Tsbaikh (Bienne 1881 - Petropolis, Brazilia, 1942), pou an kai demosieutekan polles phores kai se diaphores metaphraseis sten Ellada se proegoumenes dekaeties, paramenoun kat'ousian agnostes sto elleniko koino pou anakaluptei xana ton Stephan Tsbaikh ta teleutaia khronia. Grammenes apo enan apo tous diasemoterous autokheires tes logotekhnias, ekhoun koino paronomaste ten autokheiria kai biaious thanatous.
To AMOK, e ektenestere kai diasemotere apo tis istories, pragmateuetai ten apomonose kai ten apoleia tes logikes kai tou eautou enos giatrou se mia zougkla ton Tropikon tes Malaisias. Sto EPEISODIO STE LIMNE TES GENEUES anakaluptetai gumnos se mia skhedia enas Rosos lipotaktes polemou. Ste LEPORELLA, mia allokote uperetria me anuparkte zoe sto arkhontiko enos baronou stis okhthes tou Dounabe, eroteuetai to aphentiko tes me katastrophikes sunepeies. Sto klasiko kai poludemosieumeno STO PhOS TOU PhEGGARIOU ekhoume ten istoria enos tapeinomenou pathous s' ena mikro galliko limani, opou brisketai tukhaia o aphegetes-suggrapheas, me ena aristotekhniko diphoroumeno telos. Ste BEATRIKE TSENTSI, me allo aphegematiko uphos, o Tsbaikh anadiapragmateuetai enan aimostage thrulo mesa apo ten Istoria, dinontas mia nea poietike diastase sto tragiko kai katastrophiko pathos.
Sto Epimetro tes ekdoses demosieuetai mia sugklonistike epistole tou Tsbaikh apo ten Petroupole tes Brazilias ston Phrants Berphel kai te gunaika tou Alma ton Noembrio tou 1941 kathos kai to dokimio tou P.K. Tsouka <>guro apo to motibo tou thanatou kai tes autokheirias sto ergo kai te zoe tou Tsbaikh."ò
ïLes quatorze essais regroupes dans ce volume, publies a l'origine dans divers journaux et revues, couvrent une periode allant de 1960 a 1985. James Baldwin y evoque les marches pour les droits civiques, les raisons de son exil en France, ses rencontres avec Martin Luther King, sa critique de l'education aux Etats-Unis ou encore sa celebration de la langue noire. Explorant les tensions et non-dits qui touchent son pays, Baldwin offre une analyse pertinente, severe et subtile de la societe americaine qui n'a rien perdu de son actualite ni de sa necessite. Ces textes dressent le portrait d'un homme dont la perspicacite, l'engagement et l'ecriture ont ouvert la voie a de futurs grands ecrivains noirs americains. <>Toni Morrison - See more at: http://vitrine.edenlivres.fr/publicat..."¢
üEnas skenothetes brisketai agria dolophonemenos sto upogeio tou Theatrou Plakas. O Astunomos Khares Kokkinos kai oi sunergates tou tha klethoun na dialeukanoun mia upothese pou anamenetai na apaskholesei ten koine gnome. Suntoma tha antilephthoun oti tha khreiastei na anazetesoun ta aitia tes dolophonias sto skoteino parelthon tou skenothete, xetuligontas ena koubari koinon mustikon, sugkalupses kai bias sten kardia tes semerines Athenas.
Tautokhrona, o gios tou sarantapentare Astunomou sullambanetai me kategories pou tha ton anagkasoun na boutexei sto diko tou oikogeneiako parelthon. E piese tou khronou kai ta sphragismena stomata tha apodeixoun oti ta pragmata den einai pote apla gia osous brethekan sto piso kathisma.
Se mia koinonia opou oloi einai enokhoi, kapoioi tha plerosoun to timema, metaxu auton kai o Khares Kokkinos. Oi anakriseis tha sunthesoun mia toikhographia ton katoikon tes Athenas pou protagonistei se mia istoria pou den tha uperkhe, an den uperkhe e pole kai tipota den tha meinei sto skotadi kato apo ton lampro elio tes."£

†
Anatheoremene ekdose tou Neverwhere pou perilambanei prologo tou suggraphea, alla kai mia epipleon istoria.
Kato apo tous dromous tou Londinou, kato apo ton kosmo ton kheiropiasto tou Edo kai tou Tora, uparkhei ki enas kosmos agnostos, aperantos, mustikos, skoteinos, aneipotos: o kosmos tou Pote kai Pouthena. Ton katoikoune terata kai aggeloi, kalogeroi kai phoniades, kunegoi kai theria, lestes ki agathouledes, tukhodioktes kai probata. Einai gematos tromaktikes abussous kai palatia pou phtanoun os to kentro tes ges. Kai mono osoi st' aletheia den ekhoun tipota, osoi glistrane kai pephtoun apo tis rogmes tou <>kosmou, mporoun na pernane apo ton enan kosmo ston allon: ta pontikia ton uponomon, oi astegoi, oi phugades, oi treloi.
O Ritsarnt zei mia taktopoiemene, metremene zoe ston Pano Kosmo tes Pragmatikotetas, otan mia kai mone anthropine stigme, mia stigme kalosunes, tha ton buthisei s' enan kosmo kato apo ton kosmo, s' enan khrono exo apo ton khrono, s' enan laburintho aperanto, pou oi dromoi tou khanontai sto apoluto skotadi e sto apoluto kako, gia n' anaduthoun xana ekei pou kaneis den tous perimenei. Brisketai pagideumenos sto Pote kai Pouthena - kai se mia peripeteia pou tinazei ston aera kathe ennoia topou, khronou kai taxes, opos ta exere mekhri tote ste zoe tou.
<>Publishers Weekly"•
¢To 1985 o dekaenniakhronos Phrank Makei kai to koritsi tou, Rozi Nteili, katastronoun ena mustiko skhedio na klephtoun kai na pane sten Agglia gia na xekinesoun ekei te zoe tous makria apo tis problematikes oikogeneies tous. E Rozi omos den tha paei sto rantebou tous kai o Phrank tha upothesei pos aplos apophasise na ten kopanesei mone tes. Epi eikosi duo khronia o Phrank, o opoios ginetai mustikos astunomikos, tha apophugei na epistrepsei sten palia tous geitonia sto Doublino, ston Topo ton Piston. Ospou mia mera e mikrotere aderphe tou, e Tzaki, tou anakoinonei pos bretheke e balitsa tes Rozi s' ena egkataleleimmeno spiti. O Phrank aprothuma episkeptetai to meros kai tote ola anatrepontai: Mepos e Rozi den ephuge mone tes, khoris auton, alla kapoios ten empodise na paei ste sunantese tous;"∞

≠
O Estempan anagkazetai na kleisei to xulourgeio tou ste mikre ispanike pole Olmpa, aphenontas sto dromo tous upallelous tou. Oi tupseis ton anagkazoun na anazetesei ta aitia pou ton odegesan s' aute ten epiloge kai na diereunesei ton ditto rolo tou os thute kai thumatos. Koitazontas to eidolo tou ston kathrephte -enan anthropo khoris idiaitera kharismata-, anakaluptei mia eikona phtiagmene apo gkremismena oneira kai khamena idanika. Guro apo ton Estempan xediplonetai enas thiasos exilasterion thumaton, apleston apateonon kai aneleeton kunegon tou eukolou kerdous.
Ten idia ora o Akhmet, metanastes apo to Maroko, anakaluptei duo ptomata stis okhthes tou baltou tes Olmpa. Isos sto balto na uparkhoun perissotera ptomata, alla o Akhmet, tromokratemenos ste skepse oti tha mporouse na kategorethei gia tous phonous, to bazei sta podia. O baltos, pou stadiaka apokta auxanomeno sumboliko baros, einai sugkhronos mia abussos pou katapinei tis apodeixeis ton egklematon kai xeplenei tis diephtharmenes suneideseis...
To biblio tou Raphael Tsirmpes perigraphei mia koinonia pou ekhei perielthei se aposunthese, opos kai oloklere e khora pou bionei sklere krise kai ekhei katalephthei apo paniko.
To kalutero ispaniko muthistorema ton teleutaion eikosi pente khronon sumphona me skhetike psephophoria tes ephemeridas El Mundo."≥
∞O Ounto Mpergker, eikosipente khronon, ekhei pathiastei se bathmo ethismou me ta paikhnidia strategikes. Sunodeuomenos apo ten arraboniastikia tou pegainei gia merikes meres sten Kosta Mpraba. Einai e prote phora pou kanoun diakopes mazi. Sto domatio tou xenodokheiou, o Ounto psakhnei na brei nees strategikes paiximatos gia to Trito Raikh, ena epitrapezio paikhnidi sto opoio ekhei ginei dexiotekhnes. To zeugari den argei na sunantesei duo allous Germanous kathos kai kapoious musteriodeis ntopious, ton Luko, to Arni kai ton Kameno. Gia ton teleutaio, kaneis akribos den xerei pos paramorphotheke. Aphou prota ton muesei o Ounto, o Kamenos tha apodeikhtei tromeros antipalos sto Trito Raikh. Poio einai omos to pragmatiko diakubeuma autes tes partidas;
Me to muthistorema auto, grammeno to 1989, o Mpolanio mas kharizei ena ergo sunarpastiko , me deleteriode goeteia. O suggrapheas tou 2666 exereuna tis morphes pou pairnoun to kako kai e trela kai stokhazetai puretika pano ste skhese tes koultouras -os paikhnidiou e os logotekhnias- me ten pragmatikoteta.
Enas goeteutikos tropos na gnorisete ton Mpolanio... To Trito Raikh einai analaphra asteio, einai omos, tautokhrona, arketa aikhmero kai paraxeno oste na sugkatalegetai sta kalutera erga tou suggraphea. -The Economist
To teleio muthistorema... Sumponetiko, enokhletiko, bathia sugkinetiko, einai ena doro tou suggraphea pros emas.
-NPR
Skephteite ton Kaphka se parathalassio theretro... Gia osous zetane apo te logotekhnia na tous empneei to phobo kai ten kakhupopsia akome kai mprosta sta pio peza pragmata, To Trito Raikh sas perimenei.
-The Cleveland Plain Dealer
O Mpolanio einai eidikos sto na demiourgei atmosphaira... sten paradose ton zopheron romans durs tou Georges Simenon... e ton apoluta elegkhomenon paraistheseon tou Alain Robbe-Grillet.
-The Wall Street Journal"º
πBerolino, 1943.
O Mperni Gkounter ekhei egkataleipsei ten Politike Astunomia kai ergazetai sto germaniko Grapheio Egklematon Polemou sto Berolino. Stous kuklous tou Grapheiou anaphores kanoun logo gia ten uparxe enos omadikou taphou sto dasos tou Katin, pou brisketai konta sto Smolensk tes katekhomenes apo tous Germanous Rosias* enas lukos, skabontas to edaphos sto dasos, ekhei anasurei anthropina upoleimmata. Kaneis den xerei se poion anekoun. Uparkhoun upopsies pos o taphos einai gematos me nekrous Polonous stratiotes tous opoious ektelesan oi Sobietikoi. Gia ton Germano upourgo Propagandas, Giozeph Gkempels, e apodeixe tes enokhes ton Roson tha odegesei me mathematike akribeia ste diaspase tes enotetas ton Summakhikon Dunameon.
Ti tha sumbei omos an e aletheia einai diaphoretike; O Mperni Gkounter kaleitai na brei ten akre tou nematos. Antimetopos me ten ome pragmatikoteta, antilambanetai oti e aletheia einai allo ena thuma tou polemou."√
¿Den eudokimese telika os nekrothaphtes ste these tou Eutaxia o Stephanos o Ladikos. Monakha mia kedeia prolabe na diekperaiosei kai aute etan tes meteras tou. Dioti e Patra, ek tou Kleopatra, Ladikou, to genos Kouma, e eponomazomene kai Ksulaggouro kapote, otan etan akmaia, upo ton zelophthonon gunaikon tes mikras nesou, apebiose aiphnidios se elikia 66 eton, pithanotata apo anakope kardias sumphona me te gnomateuse tou agrotikou giatrou, treis molis meres aphotou anelabe kathekonta entos nekrotapheiou o monakhogios tes. Egeire to kephali tes aristera san labomeno poulaki, opos kathotan sto katophli tou spitiou tes to apogeuma tes Deuteras 19es MaIou kai xepsukhese esukha. San na apokoimetheke gluka kato apo ton anoixiatiko elio. Eikhe kai ena apolutos emphanes oso kai ainigmatiko meidiama sta kheile tes, to opoio an kai kata koron ermeneuteke os adiapseusto tekmerio tou oti ephuge apo te zoe ikanopoiemene, isos na etan telika monon epitimetiko aphou, opos pikrokhola apophantheke kai o peripteroukhos kapetan Paraskhos Psilakes kounontas pano kato to kephali tou apogoeteumenos apo ten apolutos pleon diakrite koinonike tes nesou parakme, e makaritissa isos proeide logo mias pithanes prothanatias eklampses ta osa alloprosalla epakolouthesan ten exodo autes.
Prodromos mias metakatanalotikes epokhes e entelos anisorropos etan telika o nekrothaphtes Stephanos Ladikos; E koinonia tou mikrou nesiou pantos den mporese na apodekhtei tis draseis tou entos nekrotapheiou kai tis apopseis tou peri sarkiou ton nekron, kai etsi ton apepempsan suntoma apo to posto tou.
Mia noubela pou aphegeitai me mprio te skhase anamesa sto iero kai to geloio, to sustema tes topikes koinonias kai to oikosustema tes phutokoinonias."«
ƒSte "Sunomosia enantion tes Amerikes"o Philip Poth xekina apo ena phantastiko alla akros ephialtiko senario: Ti tha ginotan an stis ekloges tou 1940 kerdize, anti gia ton Demokratiko Pouzbelt, o Pepoumplikanos upopsephios, ethnikos "eroas ton aitheron", alla kai antisemites kai prosopikos philos tou Xitler, Tsarls Lintmpergk; Poio tha etan to prosopo mias Amerikes pou upographei sumphono philias me ton Xitler kai ten Iaponia; Pos tha phainotan ston upoloipo kosmo, an o upourgos exoterikon tou G Paikh, o phon Pimpentrop, khoreue bals ston Leuko Oiko; Kai poio tha etan to mellon ton ekatommurion Amerikanoebraion se mia Amerike opou ton proto logo ekhei o antisemitismos;
O megalos Amerikanos suggrapheas mas dinei ena phantastiko politiko thriler kai tautokhrona skiagraphei me aristotekhniko tropo ten tragodia mias tetramelous oikogeneias tou Niou Tzerzi: ton Poth, me ton eptakhrono Philip na brisketai sto epikentro tou sunarpastikou, eniote asteiou alla kai sugkinetikou autou muthistorematos, sto opoio orismenoi isos doun mia skoteine, politike allegoria gia te semerine Amerike."Œ
ÀO Khans Sner, gonos plousias kai iskhures oikogeneias, egkataleipei to patriko tou spiti, aediasmenos apo ten pseutia kai ten upokrisia ton dikon tou kai ton "iskhuron" pou tous peristoikhizoun, kai dialegei to mono epaggelma pou ton antiprosopeuei: ginetai klooun, dinei parastaseis apo pole se pole, ki ekhei mazi tou te Mari, ten prote kai monadike tou agape. Epeita apo exi khronia duskoles sumbioses, e Mari ton egkataleipei gia na pantreutei enan spoudaio paragonta tou germanikou katholikismou, ki o Khans, pou den kataphernei na ten xeperasei, katrakulaei stathera. Zetianos pia, tha katalexei sta skalia tou siderodromikou stathmou tes Bonnes, perimenontas te Mari na epistrepsei apo to gamelio taxidi tes."Œ
ÀSto taxidi tou mekhri to eskhato ploto semeio tou potamou Kogko, os kubernetes tou atmoploiou kapoias apoikiakes emporikes etaireias, o Tsarli Marloou parakolouthei ton adephago kai apanthropo paralogismo pou krubetai piso apo to proskhema tou ekpolitismou ton agrion. Parallela, to taxidi auto einai kai mia okhi ligotero ephialtike periegese sta skoteina bathe tes anthropines psukhes, sto aluto ainigma tes anthropines uparxes. Ki akoma, sto prosopo tou Kourts, o Konrant prodiagraphei me monadike oxuderkeia, os phusiologike aporroia tou dutikou politismou, ton tupo ton kharismatikon egeton pou aimatokulisan ten Europe liga khronia argotera.
"E Kardia tou skotous", grammene to 1900, sten epokhe tes sunebale semantika sto diethnes kinema diamarturias gia tis katakhreseis ton Belgon sto Kogko, argotera egine kentriko semeio anaphoras stous "Kouphious anthropous" tou T.S. Eliot kai ta teleutaia khronia khresimopoietheke os apheteria gia ten tainia tou Kopola <>."—
ŒKathe photographia kai mia istoria. Ena sugkinetiko photographiko odoiporiko, opos auto apotupotheke se perissoteres apo pentakosies gualines stereoskopikes plakes tou giatrou kai photographou Nisem Lebe, melous epiphanous oikogeneias tes romaniotikes ebraikes koinotetas ton Ioanninon. Oi photographies brethekan tukhaia sten katokhe enos mikropolete pou kalouse ton kosmo na skupsei sto xulino kouti kai na dei - me to azemioto: <>.
Ena goeteutiko taxidi sto khrono, pou xekina apo ten teleutaia dekapentaetia tes othomanikes kuriarkhias sta Ioannina kai diatrekhei ola ta semantika istorika gegonota tes epokhes, mia goeteutike periegese sta kosmopolitika kentra tou tote kosmou, kurios omos enas elakhistos phoros times se ena plethos anthropon pou diaphoretika tha paremenan apla onomata ston katalogo thumaton sto Mouseio tou Olokautomatos."”
–To proto muthistorema tes aisthematikes logotekhnias musteriou (sensation novel), ena ergo pou sunduazei tis sugkineseis tes mesaionikes logotekhnias me ton psukhologiko realismo mias sugkhrones thematographias kai metapherei ton erota alla kai te phrike tou mesaionikou muthistorematos sta salonia mias mesoastikes biktorianes Agglias."ﬂ	
‹	O APhEGETES TES ISTORIAS -enas tupikos antieroas tes epokhes mas, anthropos aplos, pou den epithumei para na zesei me axioprepeia-, ekhontas brethei sta penenta tou khoris douleia kai me ugeia klonismene, existorei ta pathe pou uphistatai, apo ten paidike tou elikia, sten anametrese tou me te sklere pragmatikoteta. Oloi -oi gunaikes pou sunanta, oi ergodotes tou, akome kai e idia e oikogeneia tou- ton prodidoun, eno guro tou diagraphetai e eikona mias koinonias pou, para ten epiphaneiake eumareia, buthizetai sten parakme. Mesa apo ton kheimarrode monologo tou, parakolouthoume ton agona tou na stathei orthios* oplismenos me khioumor, me phantasia kai me mia idiaitere lektike euphoria, demiourgei psephida psephida enan diko tou kosmo.
Isorropontas anamesa sto komiko kai to dramatiko, anamesa sto zotiko pseudos kai ten aletheia, o eroas tou Make Tsita apokta katholikoteres diastaseis os sumbolo tou anthropou pou, exaitias tes agathotetas tou, antimetopizei apo kathe pleura ten ekhthroteta kai ton kunismo. Sugkhronos, me te skhedon paidike athooteta tou, ginetai o kathrephtes pou antanakla to ektromatiko eidolo tes idias autes koinonias e opoia ton ekballei apo tous kolpous tes. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"‰
·<>.
O KONDOR einai istoria mias anazeteses me iliggiode takhuteta stis akhaneis ektaseis tes Khiles. Mias anazeteses pou arkhizei stis phtokhogeitonies tou Santiago, pou mastizontai apo ten anekheia kai ta narkotika, kai katalegei sten eremo Atakama, me ton anexantleto orukto plouto, pedio paranomes ekmetalleuses ton prostateuomenon parthenon periokhon tes. O Kondor einai mia boutia sten istoria tes Khiles. Apo ten katapiestike diktatoria tes dekaetias tou 1970 os ten epistrophe se mia demokratia pou androkrateitai apo tous politikous kai oikonomikous epigonous tou Pinotse. Oi daimones tes Khiles den phainontai prothumoi na apokhoresoun apo te skene. O Kondor einai protistos mia istoria agapes metaxu tes Gkampriela, mias neares Mapoutse kinematographistrias, pou te diakatekhei to pneuma tou laou tes, kai tou Estempan, dikegorou eidikeumenou stis <>, pou koubalaei os stauro to gegonos oti einai gios mias megaloastikes oikogeneias me skoteino parelthon kai plouto.
CARYL FEREY: <>."‰
·Berolino, e pio demophiles pole tes Europes. Idiaitere, me pagomenous kheimones pou den xethoriazoun ton thrulo tes, isa isa ton trephoun, me ena parelthon kai, kurios, ena paron pou einai duskolo na me se tulixoun sto sageneutiko tous dikhtu. Ti sumbainei, omos, an apophasiseis na kinetheis exo apo ton kuklo tes phemes, an prospatheseis na skaliseis ta mustika tes, an nioseis na se plakonei to gkrizo phonto kai e melagkholia tes, an xuseis ten prosopse tes Istorias, an aploseis to kheri kai phas gluka rodakina s' enan paratemeno berolineziko kepo;
To Mperlin parakolouthei to Berolino san ntokimanter, entelos upokeimenika, alla katholou prosopika; e protoprosope aphegese den einai para ena mati, o phakos tes kameras pou katagraphei mia lakhaniasmene periplanese ste mneme, mia istoria metanasteuses, mia antiparathese me ton antisemitismo, alla kai polles trupheres e pikres sunanteseis.
A.S.
***
Me rotese an ekho prosexei poso phobismenoi einai kata bathos oi Germanoi, ekhasan duo polemous, treis an baloume kai ton gallogermaniko, ki auto ton phobo den mporoun na ton xeperasoun me tipota, einai oi pio phobismenoi anthropoi tou kosmou kai oi pio ikanoi, eipe, ki ego sumphonesa, alloste ole e suzetese etan entelos paraloge kai phusika katholou politika orthe, alla apo ten alle etan mia polu oraia suzetese, eno exo to khioni epephte pukno ki emeis piname to ena poto meta to allo mesa se ekeino to katathliptiko berolineziko mparaki, sto opoio kapote sukhnaze o Nteibint Mpaoui, me tous aristerous, enallaktikous thamones tou, pou kapnizan san phougara kai prospathousan na anatrepsoun to autonoeto tes uparxes tous."Ó	
Î	Oi elikiomenoi sten Tourena lene pos mono osoi prokeitai na pethanoun akoun to kelarusma tou potamou Pamano...
To tromero kalokairi tou 1936, e Elizena Bilamprou eide tous anarkhikous na skotonoun banausa ton patera kai ton adelpho tes. Kai to '44, otan ta strateumata tou Phranko katelaban ten periokhe kapoioi skotosan mesa sten ekklesia tou khoriou ton Ouriol Phountelias, ton antra pou agapouse krupha. Apo tote e Elizenta, me ten psukhe gemate skies, ebale skopo na ekdikethei Theo kai anthropous kai na apodeixei se olous pos o Ouriol axize na timethei san pragmatikos agios.
Exenta khronia argotera e Tina, mia philesukhe daskala, briskei krummeno piso apo ton pinaka mias taxes sto palio skholiko kterio tes Tourena ena kouti me grammata tou Ouriol. Me aute ten anakalupse arkhizei na xediplonetai ena epikinduno koubari parexegeseon, eroismou kai deilias pou e akre tou brisketai khamene sten Katalonia ten epokhe tou ispanikou emphuliou. Zontaneuoun palies epodunes istories pou peristrephontai guro apo enan erota skhedon teratode, kai prosopa-kleidia pou olokleronontai tragika to ena mesa apo to allo.
E peripeteia tes autonomias tes Katalonias mesa apo tis sunepeies ton praxeon anthropon pou den epetrepsan pote ston eauto tous na sugkhoresoun."Û
Einai polu duskolo na perigrapseis ten istoria autou tou bibliou. Sunethos sto opisthophullo dinoume kapoia stoikheia gia ten ploke, sten periptose mas omos pisteuoume pos auto tha khalasei tis ekplexeis pou krubontai sto keimeno -kai einai polles. Pisteuoume pos einai semantiko na arkhiseis na to diabazeis khoris na xereis poio einai to thema tou.
An pantos arkhiseis na to diabazeis, tha pas mia megale bolta m ena agori pou legetai Mprouno. Kai arga e gregora tha bretheis, mazi me ton Mprouno, mprosta se ena surmatoplegma kai tha gnoriseis ena agori pou zei apo ten alle pleura tou surmatoplegmatos.
Surmatoplegmata san auto uparkhoun se ola skhedon ta mere tou kosmou. Eukhomaste omos pote ste zoe sou na me bretheis mprosta se kapoio apo auta."˘
ˆTo muthistorema <>tou Canek Sanchez Guevara einai mia eilikrines istoria gia tis apogoeteuseis mias genias pou pistepse stis idees tes epanastases tou Kastro, alla kai mia dieisdutike matia ste zoe ton aplon anthropon sten Kouba kata te diarkeia ton teleutaion dekaetion.
O kentrikos eroas khorizei ap' te gunaika tou kai pernaei ton perissotero khrono tou parea me mia rosida geitonissa tou, khare sten opoia anakaluptei ten apolause tes anagnoses. Ta biblia pou diabazei anoigoun stadiaka tous orizontes tou, eno ton periballei e gkriza kai diabrotike pragmatikoteta: e routina tou grapheiou, ta kathemerina mikra e megala parapona apo sunadelphous, oi dikes tou emmonikes skepseis.
Kathe mera ginetai marturas tou thliberou theamatos ton neon anthropon pou egkataleipoun to nesi me autoskhedia mesa, kai ta bradia basanizetai apo kaphkikous ephialtes stous opoious sullambanetai kai dikazetai khoris aitia. Ta pragmatika tou problemata omos tha xekinesoun otan tha klethei na ginei plerophoriodotes tou kratous."˚
¯Arkhes tes dekaetias 1930: To germaniko kratos adunatei na plerosei ta khree tou, oi xenoi piezoun, oi misthoi katrakuloun, oi apoluseis einai kathemerino phainomeno, e anergia auxanetai takhutata, oi Nazi epises. Tria khronia prin o Khitler katalabei ten exousia o Giokhanes Pinempergk kai e agapemene tou Ema, to Manari opos ten apokalei, mathainoun pos prokeitai na apoktesoun paidi kai apophasizoun na pantreutoun. Ekeinos elpizei se mia deutere douleia, alla telika apoluetai kai apo aute pou ekhei. Anagkazontai na metakomisoun sto Berolino kai ekei, anamesa se kommounistes, Nazi, Ebraious, phtokha noikokuria, poluteleis epauleis, kampare kai katagogia, prospathoun okhi aplos na exasphalisoun to psomi tous, alla kai na diasosoun ten axioprepeia tous."ˇ
¸To Paskha tou 1974 mia oikogeneia exaphanizetai ligo exo apo te Phielmpaka. E mone epizesasa einai e Empa, e kore tes oikogeneias, e opoia einai enos etous.
Tora epistrephei sto nesi opou o pateras tes kapote dieuthune ena oikotropheio me siderenia pugme. Den pernaei polus kairos kai e Empa pephtei thuma emprestikes epitheses. Kata ten ereuna tes Semanses diapistonetai oti kato apo to patoma tes trapezarias uparkhei xerameno aima. Mporei ola auta na sundeontai me ten exaphanise tes oikogeneias tes Empa;"Ä
˝Sto biblio auto o Khari Khole brisketai antimetopos me tous skoteinoterous daimones tou. Prospathontas na xeperasei ton traumatismo pou upeste kata ten exikhniase tes upotheses tou Khionanthropou, katapheugei sto Khongk Kongk kai sten paregoria tou opiou.
Sto metaxu sto Oslo, duo gunaikes briskontai nekres, ekhoun pnigei sto idio tous to aima. Ta MME trelainontai. Den uparkhoun stoikheia, e astunomike ereuna ekhei baltosei kai o Khari -o monos pou tha mporouse na boethesei- einai khamenos.
Otan o idiorruthmos epitheoretes epistrephei sto Oslo, kathos mathainei oti o pateras tou einai sta teleutaia tou, o dolophonos xanakhtupa. Ta antanaklastika tou Khari energopoiountai kai analambanei energo rolo sten ereuna, an kai den uparkhoun kai polla stoikheia.
To kheirotero ap' ola omos einai oti o psukhopathes dolophonos tha dokimasei ton Khari se epaggelmatiko alla kai prosopiko epipedo."␀␀ê@"	ÆG·z@"	ÆG·z@"	ÖÎQ∏@"	333333@"	333333@"	H·zÆG@"	R∏ÖÎQ@"	R∏ÖÎQ@"	\è¬ı(\@"	\è¬ı(\@"	ffffff@"	ÖÎQ∏Ö@"	è¬ı(\è@"	ÆG·zÆ@"	∏ÖÎQ∏@"	√ı(\è¬@"	◊£p=
